# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Data & BI Portfolio — repository ignore rules
#  Every project's data is SYNTHETIC and fully reproducible from a
#  single seed:  cd <project>/etl && python run_pipeline.py
#  So the generated data layers are not version-controlled.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Generated data layers (raw / staging / curated) ---------
*/data/raw/
*/data/staging/
*/data/curated/
*/data/interim/
*/data/quality/dq_fragments/
*/data/quality/_fragments/
# keep the human-readable DQ report and any schema samples:
!*/data/quality/dq_report.md
!*/data/quality/*.md

# --- Power BI local caches / machine-specific settings -------
**/.pbi/
*.pbix
*.pbix.tmp
*.abf

# --- Local media, not version-controlled ---------------------
*.mp4
*.mov

# --- Python -------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# --- Editors / OS ------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
